		"description": "<p>1 Action, Cone: 3. Expend 1 or more Fury Die. Creatures in the area must make a DEX save. On a fail, they take Fire damage equal to the sum of expended Fury Die + KEY. On a save, half damage. The area burns for the next minute. Creatures that enter a space take KEY Fire damage.</p><hr><p><em>[A] Choose how many Fury Dice to expend when you use it: the fire damage is their sum + KEY (half on a passed DEX save, per target on the card). The dice leave your pool once the card is posted (Undo card). With King of Fires, a damaged creature gains Smoldering (on the card).</em></p><p><em>[M] Creatures entering the burning area take KEY fire damage: roll it by hand.</em></p>",
